# pobusa-api .gitignore — v1.2.0
# v1.2.0: added graphify-out/ (a code-graphing tool's cache, not part of
# the app -- swept into a commit by accident once, never again) and the
# db.sqlite3 journal/backup files that pile up locally during migrations.
# v1.1.0: added set_r2_env.ps1 -- holds real R2 credentials, never commit.

venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal
db.sqlite3.bak_*
media/
.env
set_r2_env.ps1
staticfiles/
*.log
.DS_Store
graphify-out/
